{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-liv-waterside","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"liv-waterside","about":"Discover the elegance of waterfront living at Liv Residences Waterside, nestled in a private, gated enclave along the scenic Marina Promenade These elite residences redefine the essence of luxury living beside the water, offering a selection of premium homes, each with stunning views of Dubai Marina and the sea.Liv Residences Waterside is a beacon of contemporary lifestyle, presenting a range of 1-3 bedroom apartments, each crafted with a European flair. The residences feature expansive balconies to soak in the tranquil beauty of the Marina, and the high 2.9m ceilings add a majestic feel to each living space. The charm of Liv Waterside at Dubai Marina extends to its exclusive array of housing options, including duplex penthouses, 3-bedroom duplexes, townhouses, opulent villas, and a grand mansion, all designed to the highest standards of elegance and luxury.Inhabitants of Liv Waterside enjoy exclusive access to three levels of superior serviced amenities, ensuring a lavish lifestyle experience. These facilities, coupled with a dedicated Wellness Manager, are meticulously arranged to enhance community well-being and luxury living standards under the banner of Liv Developers.","price":2300000,"title":"Liv Waterside","bitrix":{"id":296,"pf_id":"are.2.13378","source":null,"project_id":"LIV Waterside","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Liv Waterside","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"LIV Developers","project_location":"Dubai Marina"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/liv_waterside_feature_c089ecd9dc.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/liv_waterside_feature_c089ecd9dc.webp"}],"status":"ready","_geoloc":{"lat":25.0802044,"lng":55.1407436},"country":"dubai","images1":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8